esident  of chucky cheese gene Landrum  I have been pretty competitive my life I  was twenty years old I was mr. Fort  Lauderdale I went a hundred tennis  tournaments so I did business kind of  the same way I happen to be an  aggressive guy and you'll get it done  and win the game when Nolan hired me to  do this I actually looked at myself and  said what do you know about food Jean  not thing but that was a risk Nolan  wanted to take he knew that creating  something unorthodox required  visionaries not experts set in their  ways experts don't understand the future  too many times you have to untie  so when it came to spinning up the  Chucky Cheese project I thought Jane  would be the perfect guy so where did  Jean start well with food  Pizza makes sense because families left  pizza and guess what it takes 20 minutes  to make a pizza so while they're waiting  the kids are playing the games and I had  Chuck actually deliver the pizza now I  went down south and find the guy who did  costumes for Disney I said look I don't  want a mouse Disney's got Mickey and I  don't want a rat is too hardcore I want  a soft rat and he did it and after only  three months of work chucky cheese pizza  time theatre opened its doors for the  first time on May 17th 1977  [Music]  everybody is willing to say that talking  robots in a pizza parlor with a lot of  games was a really stupid idea and in  fact the day we opened I knew we'd  screwed up the place wasn't big enough  [Music]  my joint was filled there wasn't a seat  and once I learned how to do it I opened  a store a week 50 stores I opened in one  year  I have no fear I knew that it was going  to do well  Chucky cheese's initial stores were a  hit but at the parent company Atari  things were going a little differently  Warner bought Atari and all of a sudden  you had a whole bunch of New York suits  pruning my pet projects I was really  upset about that and it dawned on me  that I was having a lot more fun working  on Chucky Cheese 